mdwriter (23.08.5+mdwriter1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial fork of ghostwriter 23.08.5 (Qt5/KF5), rebranded as mdwriter so it
    can be installed alongside the stock ghostwriter package.
  * Feature: preview-first layout — rendered preview by default, source editor
    toggled with Ctrl+Shift+E.
  * Feature: import Visual Studio Code color themes (built-in and installed
    extension themes) via Settings > Themes > "Import from VS Code...".
  * Feature: VS Code-matching default fonts (Liberation Mono for code,
    Ubuntu for preview text).
  * Fix: firstAvailableFont() silently skipped installed fonts.

